@startuml ambulance-model-uz
hide circle
hide empty members
title TTY chaqiruvi yozuvi qanday tuzilgan

class Patient [[https://dhp.uz/fhir/core/StructureDefinition-uz-core-patient.html{UZ Core Patient profilini ochish}]]
class AmbulanceEncounter [[StructureDefinition-ambulance-encounter.html{AmbulanceEncounter profilini ochish}]] #E8F0FE
class Location [[https://dhp.uz/fhir/core/StructureDefinition-uz-core-location.html{UZ Core Location profilini ochish}]]
class Condition [[https://dhp.uz/fhir/core/StructureDefinition-uz-core-condition.html{UZ Core Condition profilini ochish}]]
class ServiceRequest [[https://dhp.uz/fhir/core/StructureDefinition-uz-core-servicerequest.html{UZ Core ServiceRequest profilini ochish}]]

Patient "1" <-- "0..*" AmbulanceEncounter : « subject »
AmbulanceEncounter "0..*" --> "1" Location : « location.location »
AmbulanceEncounter "0..*" --> "0..1" Location : « admission.destination »
AmbulanceEncounter "0..*" --> "0..*" Condition : « reason.value, diagnosis.condition »
AmbulanceEncounter "0..*" --> "0..*" ServiceRequest : « basedOn »

caption Klinik graf: diagramma o'qilishi oson bo'lishi uchun tashkilotlar, tibbiyot xodimlari va boshqa ishtirokchilarga havolalar ko'rsatilmagan.

@enduml
